  "facets": [
    {
      "title": "How it works",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "Referenced associations are not autosaved by default when saving their parent; enable `autosave` when required. Embedded documents are saved within the parent, and nested-attributes associations automatically gain autosave behavior. (low confidence)",
          "source": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/mongoid/current/data-modeling/associations/customize-association.md",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:952c379218fdd94d4a2af8b36a71c45a8bc474e8c2aedd7111097decd07078f3",
          "validationStatus": "SUPPORTED",
          "evidenceIds": [
            "ev:02c0f8660bc9f520f642bbb9af74e9b0ec500f8ecc13d57b9ffa88e4ce07c058",
            "ev:54d1dd71c2d5e77889aa25382ddbbd1d8010603f33fb95f73d6cfa6a44488912",
            "ev:56e84d3f0a48faca6374c43a40394d3e698330695512d930df95f2556aa61588",
            "ev:cb882872c7fcbfabbab04e02a4ce7d0dc31d6e778e9cf30ae45b91d45c4b2d7d"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mongoid coerces query values to a declared field’s type when constructing a query. Wrap a value in `Mongoid::RawValue` to bypass this coercion. (low confidence)",
          "source": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/mongoid/current/interact-data/specify-query.md",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:00d7449afe05e1ec04844471481b4b12724d7fa0fb9440abfded6571e0981047",
          "validationStatus": "SUPPORTED",
          "evidenceIds": [
            "ev:2df46cf763c060d3b3e2a058b4aa3cd2caca3a163f02efd24926ea2d040c0ad2",
            "ev:921671eeaad95f0ebd6ec98d4961ca0d099448c706fe7f9ebcb684211e48f45b"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A collection query can filter embedded fields using dot notation, but it returns top-level model instances even when every condition references embedded fields. (high confidence)",
          "source": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/mongoid/current/interact-data/specify-query.md",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:df98618a8ccd73f0e3e38e1680dfdca775c688a47f4b6f6a40a0272d81cad494",
          "validationStatus": "SUPPORTED",
