          ],
          "also": [
            "https://alexbevi.com/blog/2022/09/09/performance-profiling-a-mongoid-issue-using-appprofiler/"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A persistent Mongoid model includes `Mongoid::Document`; model instances can live in a collection or be embedded, and saving converts them to BSON. (low confidence)",
          "source": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/mongoid/current/data-modeling/documents.md",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:3e0d4fa3fa5bc3cdfe6a6ec6f864e3d742f316617c1326597d336f3e3911a817",
          "validationStatus": "SUPPORTED",
          "evidenceIds": [
            "ev:bf85b64ced0b737094dc74f4de27a4010cf998c2e8b54937c25f1e06d3b358df",
            "ev:ea0f6d4ca5b6a0a3deed6237865d198a0144cb1d49369aa940bb6794622e64dd"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Referenced associations support `has_one`, `has_many`, `belongs_to`, and `has_and_belongs_to_many`. By default a belongs-to child stores the parent identifier; many-to-many associations store arrays of associated identifiers on both sides unless the inverse is disabled. (low confidence)",
          "source": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/mongoid/current/data-modeling/associations/referenced-associations.md",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:0bf773eb7ac6eca4d8b31c85343e83a7b081c60da208a99b5be5efa0057509a1",
          "validationStatus": "SUPPORTED",
          "evidenceIds": [
            "ev:10990a06ffbcc3462f794fb3444047d6546d20b4a5d9767d8830217f9d523496",
            "ev:e180b6c4dba3d2fd857565cb4b7c22b10562b4272f61505257034ce72f37f886",
            "ev:fdfd7584d5bbb5868acad731152905dab3329238eca8e86b55e790d937f7abb0"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Query filters support Ruby field hashes, Query API operator hashes, and symbol operators. For fields declared in the model, Mongoid coerces filter values to the field type; `Mongoid::RawValue` bypasses that coercion. (low confidence)",
          "source": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/mongoid/current/interact-data/specify-query.md",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:251c60f2ff907388ee267a95c716e45bb9cdeee86cf26c2e19de75d735bfcf9b",
