            "ev:b1fd346e6b112b670c4452b4af2b58d0bc43ec7479c2e41111352e560b05fdcb"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "`elem_match` requires at least one array element to satisfy all supplied conditions and supports embedded associations. It does not join referenced associations; cross-collection querying needs an aggregation pipeline or separate queries. (high confidence)",
          "source": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/mongoid/current/interact-data/specify-query.md",
