        },
        {
          "text": "Mongoid provides document lifecycle callbacks for top-level and embedded models. Association callbacks `before_add`, `after_add`, `before_remove`, and `after_remove` are configured on `embeds_many`, `has_many`, or `has_and_belongs_to_many` and receive the affected document. (low confidence)",
